* 01_import.do: read the raw data and save it as Stata files
*
* master.do runs this step after settings.do sets the path globals.
* Raw data in {{.Raw}} is read-only. Never overwrite it.
{{- if .Sensitive}}
* This folder holds restricted data. It stays on the machine that may hold it
* and is never committed.
{{- end}}

* import delimited using `"{{.Raw}}/example.csv"', clear
* save `"{{.Intermediate}}/example.dta"', replace
